Lay a trap that explodes in a radius of 2, dealing [181, 213, 237, 257, 275 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] physical damage and blinding and dazing (50% chance of each) any creature caught inside for [6, 6, 6, 7, 7 (TRAP MASTERY TL1-5; CUN 100)] turns.

This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.
